{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/481501-legendary-and-dead-dragon-blooded","id":481501,"title":"Legendary and Dead Dragon-Blooded","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-15T12:40:39-07:00","id":481501,"title":"Legendary and Dead Dragon-Blooded","content":"The Realm has been around for a few Dragon-Blooded generations, and the Shogunate many Dragon-Blooded generations before that openly ruling the world as the Princes of the Earth. Empires use (stories of) their dearly departed heroes who sacrificed all for the aggrandizement of their motherland as morale boosters, propaganda and to increase tax compliance (from the grand to the mundane). <br /> <br /> Yet, as familiar as I am with dozens of living Dragon-Blooded, I have read of very few or next to none of these characters. The closest are the Immaculate Dragons, but they're more like saints than people. I'm thinking of someone like a George McGovern, who tried but didn't succeed yet influenced many to continue his cause after he was no longer around to further it. <br /> <br /> I know, I know, you should be able to interact with the Dragon-Blooded NPC to be worth the wordcount, but being dead is less of a hindrance than it might seem at first reading. The obvious is being a ghost. But the less than obvious would be a character similar to Jon Arryn from Game of Thrones, one with profound influence on some of the present-day characters who happens to be dead, either through a shared past or shared ideology. Perhaps a shared dream of what the Realm is or how the Ten Thousand Dragons are destined to fight as one.<br /> <br /> Am I missing a set of references tucked away in some Artifact writeup like that Solar who went all octopus in the First Age? Or do I need to go write a bunch of these for my campaign?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T13:19:39-07:00","id":481546,"title":"","content":"I know of no dead famous Dragon-Blooded. Also, I don't want to derail the thread too much, but which artifact has that description? Because that sounds nuts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5454-mcallister","name":"McAllister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5454_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T13:24:28-07:00","id":481552,"title":"","content":"Saibok Guato is a pretty legendary and very dead DB, so are all the house heads who aren't still alive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T14:23:42-07:00","id":481589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>McAllister</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/481501-legendary-and-dead-dragon-blooded?p=481546#post481546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know of no dead famous Dragon-Blooded. Also, I don't want to derail the thread too much, but which artifact has that description? Because that sounds nuts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Its in the writeup of Primordial Principle Emulation, a Solar charm in Dreams of the First Age.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T19:59:03-07:00","id":481879,"title":"","content":"Then you can look at the 5 major gens of Lookshy, which mention the founders. No real write-ups. You can swipe any write-up you have, alter the verbs to past tense and stick a new name on them; but I do not know of write-ups for dead DBs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like my Avatar? Courtesy of<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> Jen</span>! : <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Anybody want their characters to be experimented on ? </span>post 98<br /> <i>An Exalt is never unarmed.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4018-l-het-esh","name":"L'het'esh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T20:29:42-07:00","id":481891,"title":"","content":"There are brief mentions of the House founders. Tepet for example, IIRC was a royal consort, a great general and left his sword behind, and it's a relic with great significance to the modern Tepets.<br /> <br /> Bagrash Kol I think was a Dragonblood? The guy who raised a sorcerous empire in the north that later was destroyed?<br /> <br /> That's pretty much it though. I've noticed this too. Besides mentions of the Empress's direct family (consorts and children), there's very little history of the Realm's heroes.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T02:52:37-07:00","id":482177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tikor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/481501-legendary-and-dead-dragon-blooded#post481501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Empires use (stories of) their dearly departed heroes who sacrificed all for the aggrandizement of their motherland as morale boosters, propaganda and to increase tax compliance (from the grand to the mundane).</div> </div> </div> </div>Some of them do.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/481501-legendary-and-dead-dragon-blooded?p=481589#post481589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Its in the writeup of Primordial Principle Emulation, a Solar charm in Dreams of the First Age.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nono, Primordial Principle Emulation was in Glories of the Most High; K'Tula had been referenced in Lands of Creation somewhere in the write-up about the West*, including the whole &quot;octopus body&quot; thing and how she was trying to create a new race of humanity, and Nephilpal used her as the jumping off point for the Charm by introducing the premise that she couldn't develop Solar Charms to make use of her new form.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/481501-legendary-and-dead-dragon-blooded?p=481891#post481891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Bagrash Kol I think was a Dragonblood? The guy who raised a sorcerous empire in the north that later was destroyed?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, he was explicitly mortal.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">there's very little history of the Realm's heroes.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd personally find that to be in keeping with some of the ethos of the Realm.<br /> <br /> Still, I suppose a bit of expansion on that front, regarding things that develop <i>outside</i> of the ethos, would not be amiss in a more comprehensive book on the Realm.<br /> <br /> The upcoming book is looking to develop the culture of the Houses a bit more, so that seems like the spot to do it; let's wait and see.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T03:09:30-07:00","id":482180,"title":"","content":"There have been a few &quot;famous dead Dragon Blooded&quot; like the Seven Tiger Generals or Manosque. But by and large those are very much the exception. In general I think you'll be stuck writing up such NPCs for your campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T05:25:15-07:00","id":482227,"title":"","content":"There's also the problem that a dead character can rarely* be interacted with to generate story in the fashion that a living character, or even an object can. They don't hold philosophies or want things counter to yours; at best, they serve as a formative influence on a person or people you <i>can</i> meaningfully interact with, but even then, your interaction's with those people, not the dead person (after all, as a certain Pope proved, dead men are not difficult opponents).<br /> <br /> Probably the most common story elements to come up regarding dead characters (that aren't ghosts!) in Exalted games, in my experience, are as follows:<br /> 1) You are descended from/the reincarnation of said dead person.<br /> 2) Dead person isn't so dead after all, <i>what a twist</i>!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> *Ghosts, as usual, provide an exception.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T05:41:48-07:00","id":482236,"title":"","content":"When I made my point about the new book fleshing out the Realm by detailing manners in which it deviates from the central ethos, I was thinking about how Compass: Autochthonia fleshed out the Octet by doing the same.<br /> <br /> That book did a couple of other things right. Like the nation founders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T16:30:17-07:00","id":484940,"title":"","content":"I wrote up a plot that involved a legendary Dragon-Blood a while back. He was Padishah Goyaa, the Seventh Tiger, a great sorcerer-warlord of the Shogunate who went into hibernation in his manse when his compatriots were destroyed by the nascent Realm. Learning that the Empress was out of the picture and the Sword of Creation was dormant again, he came out of retirement and drew up plans of conquest against his old dominion in the South so he could strike against the Realm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":2093,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","user":"Crumplepunch","date":". 04-19-2015, 08:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T18:12:20-07:00","id":484961,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tikor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/481501-legendary-and-dead-dragon-blooded#post481501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Realm has been around for a few Dragon-Blooded generations, and the Shogunate many Dragon-Blooded generations before that openly ruling the world as the Princes of the Earth. Empires use (stories of) their dearly departed heroes who sacrificed all for the aggrandizement of their motherland as morale boosters, propaganda and to increase tax compliance (from the grand to the mundane).</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a setting where hero worship provides mystical power to <i>that individual</i>, and where being dead is not necessarily an end to ambition. It's also a setting where solar exaltation occurs to mortals inspired to heroic deeds.<br /> <br /> Thus the Immaculate Philosophy attributes past glories, and abstract ideals, to fictional heroes for the Princes of the Earth to emulate, while mortals are instead encouraged to revere the Dragon-blooded host as a whole, and to aspire to reincarnate among them via lives of diligent meekness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T11:34:45-07:00","id":485520,"title":"","content":"About the only dead terrestrials of note I know of is the ones which went all dark side and ended up either as ghosts are tied to the underworld in some way. Marama who ran the Marama's Fell death camp was a first age Terrestrial who died during the shogunate and was hinted at returning. Then you have that one which is ruling the underworld version of a floating first age city in the north.<br /> <br /> Sadly I wouldn't call either of those heroic, though I am sure that some in the Wyld Hunt would treat Marama as a hero.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T13:12:36-07:00","id":485606,"title":"","content":"Has EVERYONE forgot General Nefavarin? Leader of the 7th Legion? Founder of Lookshy? VERY, VERY dead?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T14:07:18-07:00","id":485701,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/481501-legendary-and-dead-dragon-blooded?p=485606#post485606\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has EVERYONE forgot General Nefavarin? Leader of the 7th Legion? Founder of Lookshy? VERY, VERY dead?</div> </div> </div> </div>I will go you one better, has everyone forgotten that the shogunate was actually ruled over by a terrestrial shogun? The bloodline of which may or may not still be kicking around. Forgetting about that is kind of on par with forgetting about MRL or the Scarlet Empress.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T14:28:06-07:00","id":485719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/481501-legendary-and-dead-dragon-blooded?p=485701#post485701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The bloodline of which may or may not still be kicking around.</div> </div> </div> </div>In Ink Monkeys there's a dude with Breeding 5 imprisoned in Malfeas in one of those sorcerous hibernation crystals, who believes himself to be the Heir to the Shogunate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T16:31:08-07:00","id":485820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thoth</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will go you one better, has everyone forgotten that the shogunate was actually ruled over by a terrestrial shogun?</div> </div> </div> </div> Name but one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T17:46:07-07:00","id":485866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/481501-legendary-and-dead-dragon-blooded?p=485820#post485820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Name but one.</div> </div> </div> </div>That being the issue. With General Nefvarin we have a name. I don't think we even know the *gens* name of the Shogun's bloodline. Though we have gotten a pretty direct statement that the Shogun's bloodline was wiped out, since the Realm was in such complete disarray and uproar when the Empress took the throne. She needed a vaccum to slip into after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T21:42:11-07:00","id":486017,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/481501-legendary-and-dead-dragon-blooded?p=485866#post485866\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That being the issue. With General Nefvarin we have a name. I don't think we even know the *gens* name of the Shogun's bloodline. Though we have gotten a pretty direct statement that the Shogun's bloodline was wiped out, since the Realm was in such complete disarray and uproar when the Empress took the throne. She needed a vaccum to slip into after all.</div> </div> </div> </div>One was mentioned in MoEP: DB (Gherin) as a maybe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[